```

I don't know of a `createClient` export in the inngest package, so I'd drop that import. If you see a TypeScript error on it, that confirms it. Also check that nothing else in your project shadows the name `Inngest`, and that you're importing from `'inngest'` and not a local file.

Note that `eventKey` is optional. The SDK also reads `INNGEST_EVENT_KEY` from the environment on its own, so you can omit it if that variable is set.

